{"id":"vod_bf_23240","vodId":"23240","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"命运之夜","name_cn":"命运之夜","date":"2006-01-01","year":"2006","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-24/2685445d07d8660b6b6995e33bad318d.jpg"},"summary":"十年前，几乎毁灭世界的大灾难中，卫宫士郎被魔术师卫宫切嗣所救，成为其养子。　　十年后，士郎为履行与已故的养父之间的约定——成为“正义的伙伴”，而每日不停的进行魔术锻炼。　　偶然的一天，士郎被卷入了称为“圣杯战争”的魔术师之间的对决。规则是一位魔术师与一位“英灵”结成契约。所谓“圣杯战争”，胜利者可以获得圣杯来实现任何愿望。于是，七位魔术师与七位“英灵”一起加入了这个为了创造奇迹的厮杀之中。　　卫宫士郎深知，十年前的那场大灾难就是“圣杯战争”引起的，为了避免悲剧再次发生，他与自己的“英灵”Sabar一起，投身于这充满危险与艰辛的”圣杯战争”之中。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"剧情,动画,冒险,情,日韩动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 08:39:26","classic":true,"classicRank":27,"franchise":"Fate","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/mingyunzhiye/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/mingyunzhiye/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/mingyunzhiye/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/mingyunzhiye/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/mingyunzhiye/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/mingyunzhiye/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/mingyunzhiye/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/mingyunzhiye/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/mingyunzhiye/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/mingyunzhiye/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/mingyunzhiye/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/mingyunzhiye/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/mingyunzhiye/第13集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/mingyunzhiye/第14集/inde